@startuml LLMCascade
' PlantUML Diagram
' Edit this file to create your diagram

' High-quality settings optimized for Google Docs
' Balance between resolution and size to prevent cutoff
skinparam dpi 400
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 18
skinparam participantFontSize 16
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam noteFontSize 12
skinparam noteTextAlignment left

' Compact layout to fit page width
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 5
skinparam SequenceMessageAlign center

' Prevent diagram cutoff
scale 0.4

title LLM Cascade

participant "Client" as client
participant "Envoy" as envoy
participant "ext_proc server" as ext_proc
participant "Reflector" as reflector
participant "EPP X" as epp_cx
participant "EPP Y" as epp_cy
participant "Backend X" as backend_x
participant "Backend Y" as backend_y

activate envoy
note over client,envoy
  **TX1 -- Transaction 1 (original request by the client)**
end note
client -> envoy: 1. POST MaaS-URL "model":"Cascade" "stream":true
envoy -> ext_proc: 2. [gRPC, no X-LLMCascade-Retry-Request sentinel header, TX1]
activate ext_proc
note over ext_proc
  **BBR LLMCascadeRequesPlugin [request path]**
  1. model:X // defined in Cascade={X,Y}
  2. logprobs:true
  3. hdr X-Gateway-Base-Model-Name:X
  4. clearRouteCache()
end note
ext_proc -> envoy: 3. HeadersResponse + BodyResponse [mutated]
envoy -> epp_cx: 4. upstream HTTP model:X logprobs:true stream:true
activate epp_cx
epp_cx -> backend_x: 5. model:X logprobs:true stream:true
activate backend_x
backend_x -> epp_cx: 6. SSE stream {delta, logprobs} [chunks...]
epp_cx -> envoy: 7. SSE stream {delta, logprobs} [chunks...]
envoy -> ext_proc: 8. response body [per chunk, gRPC]
note over ext_proc
  **BBR LLMCascadeResponsePlugin [response path]**
  1. accumulate logprobs per chunk
  2. buffer chunks -- withhold CONTINUE
end note 
backend_x -> epp_cx: 9. end_of_stream=true [last chunk]
deactivate backend_x
epp_cx -> envoy: 10. end_of_stream=true [last chunk]
deactivate epp_cx
envoy -> ext_proc: 11. response body end_of_stream=true
note over ext_proc
  **BBR LLMCascadeResponsePlugin [response path]**
  confidence = f(accumulated_logprobs) // summation
end note

alt confidence >= threshold // the threshold is pre-configured via plugin configuration
  note over ext_proc
    **High confidence path**
    Return buffered response to client
  end note
  ext_proc -> envoy: 12. body response CONTINUE [release buffered chunks]
  envoy -> client: 13. SSE stream [all buffered chunks] // the client request was served by the cheap model
else confidence < threshold
  note over ext_proc
    **BBR LLMCascadeResponsePlugin: [response path]**
	Low confidence - retry with model Y
    1. Discard the buffered response 
    2. header X-LLMCascade-Retry-Request:true // set sentinel header
	3. header X-Gateway-Base-Model-Name:Y 
    3. model:Y // set the fallback model of the cascade (expensive path)
  end note
  ext_proc -> reflector: 14. HTTP POST model:Y X-LLMCascade-Retry-Request:true
  activate reflector
  note over envoy,ext_proc
    **TX2 -- Transaction 2 (Reflector acts as new Envoy downstream client)**
  end note
  note over reflector
    **Reflector acts as simple HTTP Proxy**
 Passes request verbatim
  end note
  reflector -> envoy: 15. POST MaaS URL X-LLMCascade-Retry-Request:true X-Gateway-Base-Model-Name:Y model:Y
  envoy -> ext_proc: 16. request headers/body [gRPC, TX2]
  note over ext_proc
    **BBR LLMCascadeRequestPlugin [request path]**
   1. X-LLMCascade-Retry-Request detected
   2. clearRouteCache() -> resolves cluster:Y
  end note
end
  ext_proc -> envoy: 17. HeaderResponse pass-through + clearRouteCache
  envoy -> epp_cy: 18. upstream HTTP model:Y X-LLMCascade-Retry-Request:true
  activate epp_cy
  epp_cy -> backend_y: 19. model:Y stream:true // don't care about logprobs of Y
  activate backend_y
  backend_y -> epp_cy: 20. SSE stream [all chunks + end_of_stream]
  deactivate backend_y
  epp_cy -> envoy: 21. SSE stream [all chunks + end_of_stream]
  deactivate epp_cy
  envoy -> ext_proc: 22. response body chunks [gRPC, TX2]
  note over ext_proc
    **BBR LLMCascadeResponsePlugin [response path]**
 1. X-LLMCascade-Retry-Request detected -> skip confidence level computations
 2. buffer all Y response chunks
  end note
  ext_proc -> envoy: 23. BodyResponse CONTINUE [TX2]
  envoy -> reflector: 24. SSE response [model Y response chunks, TX2 downstream]
  reflector -> ext_proc: 25. HTTP response [model Y response chunks]
  deactivate reflector
  note over client,envoy
    **TX1 resumes -- ext_proc replaces response body with LLM Y chunks**
  end note
  note over ext_proc
    **replace response body with LLM Y chunks**
 issue CONTINUE_AND_REPLACE -> resume Envoy TX1
  end note
  ext_proc -> envoy: 26. BodyResponse CONTINUE_AND_REPLACE [model Y response body]
  deactivate ext_proc
  envoy -> client: 27. SSE response [model Y response] unconditionally
  deactivate envoy
@enduml
